    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14579" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dīvīsūra</span></b> ,
		ae, f.
		id..—Prop., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a division.</i>—Concr., <i>the fork</i> of a tree, <i><span class="en">Plin. 16,
				30, 53, § 122</span></i>.—In
			plur., <i><span class="en">Plin. 25, 13, 106, § 167</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">25, 5, 21, §
				48</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A cut</i>, <i>incision</i>, e. g. in
			bleeding a person, <i><span class="en">Cael. Aur. Acut. 3, 4, 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Tard. 2, 12, 146 sq.</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in trees: laterum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 11, 12, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
